{"version":1,"packs":[{"id":"core","sit":"foundation/grammar","name":"핵심 동사 · 연결어","icon":"🧱","desc":"어떤 상황에서도 쓰는 일꾼 단어 — 이것부터","words":[["figure out","phr","알아내다, 해결책을 찾다","A2","Let me figure out what went wrong.","뭐가 잘못됐는지 알아볼게요."],["handle","v","처리하다, 다루다","A2","I can handle the paperwork.","서류 작업은 제가 처리할 수 있어요."],["manage","v","관리하다; 간신히 해내다","A2","We managed to finish on time.","간신히 제때 끝냈어요."],["arrange","v","준비하다, 주선하다","A2","I'll arrange a meeting for Tuesday.","화요일에 미팅을 잡을게요."],["confirm","v","확정하다, 확인해 주다","A2","Could you confirm the time?","시간 확인해 주시겠어요?"],["mention","v","언급하다","A2","You mentioned a budget issue.","예산 문제를 언급하셨죠."],["suggest","v","제안하다","A2","I suggest we start small.","작게 시작하길 제안드려요."],["require","v","필요로 하다, 요구하다","B1","This setup requires admin access.","이 설정은 관리자 권한이 필요해요."],["provide","v","제공하다","A2","We provide 24/7 support.","저희는 24시간 지원을 제공합니다."],["include","v","포함하다","A2","The price includes setup.","가격에 설정이 포함돼 있어요."],["improve","v","개선하다","A2","This will improve performance.","이게 성능을 개선할 거예요."],["reduce","v","줄이다","A2","We reduced costs by 20%.","비용을 20% 줄였어요."],["increase","v","늘리다, 증가하다","A2","Traffic increased last month.","지난달 트래픽이 늘었어요."],["achieve","v","달성하다","B1","We achieved our Q3 target.","3분기 목표를 달성했어요."],["ensure","v","반드시 ~하게 하다","B1","We'll ensure there's no downtime.","다운타임이 없도록 하겠습니다."],["maintain","v","유지하다","B1","We need to maintain the SLA.","SLA를 유지해야 해요."],["prioritize","v","우선순위를 두다","B1","Let's prioritize security first.","보안을 먼저 우선합시다."],["address","v","(문제를) 다루다, 해결하다","B2","We'll address that issue today.","그 문제는 오늘 다루겠습니다."],["clarify","v","명확히 하다","B1","Could you clarify the scope?","범위를 명확히 해주시겠어요?"],["assume","v","가정하다, 추정하다","B1","I assume you've seen the report.","보고서는 보셨으리라 생각해요."],["expect","v","예상하다, 기대하다","A2","We expect a decision next week.","다음 주에 결정이 날 것으로 예상해요."],["depend on","phr","~에 달려 있다","A2","It depends on your budget.","예산에 따라 달라요."],["deal with","phr","~을 처리하다, 상대하다","A2","I'll deal with it right away.","바로 처리하겠습니다."],["come up with","phr","(아이디어를) 내놓다","B1","We came up with a new plan.","새 계획을 생각해 냈어요."],["carry out","phr","수행하다","B1","We'll carry out the migration this weekend.","이번 주말에 이전 작업을 수행합니다."],["set up","phr","설정하다, 마련하다","A2","I'll set up a call.","통화 자리를 마련할게요."],["look into","phr","조사하다, 살펴보다","B1","I'll look into it.","제가 알아볼게요."],["point out","phr","지적하다","B1","Thanks for pointing that out.","짚어주셔서 감사해요."],["however","conj","하지만, 그러나","A2","However, the timeline is tight.","하지만 일정이 빠듯해요."],["therefore","adv","그러므로","B1","Therefore, we recommend option B.","그래서 B안을 추천드립니다."],["meanwhile","adv","그동안, 한편","B1","Meanwhile, I'll prepare the draft.","그동안 제가 초안을 준비할게요."],["otherwise","adv","그렇지 않으면","B1","Otherwise, we might miss the deadline.","안 그러면 마감을 놓칠 수 있어요."],["instead","adv","대신에","A2","Let's meet online instead.","대신 온라인으로 만나죠."],["especially","adv","특히","A2","Especially in peak season.","특히 성수기에요."],["actually","adv","사실은, 실제로","A2","Actually, it's cheaper than you think.","사실 생각보다 저렴해요."],["basically","adv","기본적으로, 요컨대","A2","Basically, it's a managed service.","요컨대 매니지드 서비스예요."],["eventually","adv","결국, 마침내","B1","Eventually, they agreed.","결국 그들이 동의했어요."],["approximately","adv","대략","B1","It's approximately 3,000 dollars.","대략 3천 달러예요."],["regarding","prep","~에 관하여","B1","Regarding the invoice, I have a question.","청구서 관련해서 질문이 있어요."],["in terms of","phr","~의 측면에서","B1","In terms of cost, it wins.","비용 측면에선 이게 나아요."],["as long as","conj","~하는 한","B1","It's fine as long as it's secure.","안전하기만 하면 괜찮아요."],["in case","conj","~할 경우에 대비해","B1","I'll bring a copy in case.","혹시 몰라 사본을 가져갈게요."]]},{"id":"meeting","sit":"meeting","name":"미팅 · 회의","icon":"🤝","desc":"회의를 열고, 이끌고, 정리하는 단어","words":[["agenda","n","안건, 의제","A2","Let's go through the agenda.","안건을 살펴보죠."],["attendee","n","참석자","B1","All attendees received the deck.","참석자 모두 자료를 받았어요."],["minutes","n","회의록","B1","I'll send the minutes after the call.","통화 후 회의록 보내드릴게요."],["action item","n","실행 과제","B1","Let's wrap up with action items.","실행 과제로 마무리하죠."],["follow-up","n","후속 조치","B1","I'll send a follow-up email.","후속 메일 보내드릴게요."],["recap","n/v","요약(하다)","B1","Let me quickly recap.","빠르게 요약해 드릴게요."],["wrap up","phr","마무리하다","B1","Let's wrap up here.","여기서 마무리하죠."],["kick off","phr","시작하다","B1","Let's kick off with introductions.","소개부터 시작하죠."],["chair","v","(회의를) 주재하다","B2","Who is chairing the meeting?","회의는 누가 주재하나요?"],["facilitate","v","원활하게 진행하다","B2","I'll facilitate the workshop.","제가 워크숍을 진행할게요."],["stakeholder","n","이해관계자","B1","We need buy-in from key stakeholders.","핵심 이해관계자 동의가 필요해요."],["decision-maker","n","의사결정권자","B1","Is the decision-maker joining?","의사결정권자도 참석하나요?"],["buy-in","n","동의, 지지","B2","We don't have buy-in from finance yet.","재무팀 동의를 아직 못 얻었어요."],["alignment","n","의견 일치, 방향 정렬","B2","We need alignment on the timeline.","일정에 대해 합의가 필요해요."],["consensus","n","합의","B2","We reached a consensus.","합의에 도달했어요."],["input","n","의견, 조언","B1","Your input would be helpful.","의견 주시면 도움이 될 거예요."],["feedback","n","피드백","A2","Any feedback on the proposal?","제안서에 피드백 있으신가요?"],["concern","n","우려","B1","Do you have any concerns?","우려되는 점 있으신가요?"],["priority","n","우선순위","B1","What is your top priority?","가장 우선순위가 뭔가요?"],["timeline","n","일정","B1","The timeline looks tight.","일정이 빠듯해 보여요."],["milestone","n","주요 단계, 마일스톤","B1","The first milestone is in May.","첫 마일스톤은 5월이에요."],["deadline","n","마감","A2","The deadline is Friday.","마감은 금요일이에요."],["status","n","현황","A2","What's the status of the project?","프로젝트 현황은 어떤가요?"],["update","n/v","근황(을 알리다)","A2","Quick update on the migration.","이전 작업 간단한 업데이트예요."],["progress","n","진행","A2","We've made good progress.","진척이 좋아요."],["bottleneck","n","병목","B2","Approval is the main bottleneck.","승인이 주된 병목이에요."],["blocker","n","진행을 막는 요소","B2","Are there any blockers?","막히는 부분 있나요?"],["on track","phr","계획대로 진행 중인","B1","We're on track for launch.","출시 일정대로 가고 있어요."],["behind schedule","phr","일정보다 늦은","B1","We're a week behind schedule.","일정보다 일주일 늦어요."],["postpone","v","연기하다","B1","Can we postpone to Thursday?","목요일로 미룰 수 있을까요?"],["reschedule","v","일정을 다시 잡다","B1","I need to reschedule our call.","통화 일정을 다시 잡아야 해요."],["interrupt","v","말을 끊다","B1","Sorry to interrupt, but…","말씀 중에 죄송한데요…"],["elaborate","v","자세히 설명하다","B2","Could you elaborate on that?","그 부분 좀 더 설명해 주시겠어요?"],["summarize","v","요약하다","B1","Let me summarize the key points.","핵심을 요약할게요."],["brainstorm","v","아이디어를 모으다","B1","Let's brainstorm some options.","몇 가지 안을 브레인스토밍하죠."],["assign","v","배정하다","B1","I'll assign an owner to each task.","과제마다 담당자를 지정할게요."],["owner","n","담당자","B1","Who is the owner of this item?","이 항목 담당은 누구죠?"],["sync","n/v","맞추다, 짧은 회의","B1","Let's have a quick sync tomorrow.","내일 짧게 맞춰보죠."],["offline","adv","(회의 외) 따로","B2","Let's take that offline.","그건 따로 얘기하죠."],["parking lot","n","(나중으로) 보류 목록","C1","Let's put that in the parking lot.","그건 보류 목록에 두죠."]]},{"id":"email","sit":"comms","name":"이메일 · 연락","icon":"📬","desc":"메일과 메신저에서 매일 쓰는 단어","words":[["attach","v","첨부하다","A2","I've attached the quote.","견적서를 첨부했습니다."],["attachment","n","첨부 파일","A2","Please see the attachment.","첨부 파일을 확인해 주세요."],["forward","v","전달하다","A2","I'll forward this to my manager.","매니저에게 전달할게요."],["cc","v","참조로 넣다","B1","I've cc'd our engineer.","엔지니어를 참조로 넣었어요."],["reply","n/v","답장(하다)","A2","Thanks for the quick reply.","빠른 답장 감사해요."],["reminder","n","알림, 리마인더","A2","Just a friendly reminder.","가볍게 상기해 드려요."],["inquiry","n","문의","B1","Thank you for your inquiry.","문의 주셔서 감사합니다."],["request","n/v","요청(하다)","A2","Per your request, here is the file.","요청하신 파일입니다."],["per","prep","~에 따라","B2","Per our discussion, I updated the plan.","논의한 대로 계획을 수정했어요."],["as discussed","phr","논의한 대로","B1","As discussed, the price is final.","논의한 대로 가격은 확정이에요."],["at your convenience","phr","편하실 때","B2","Please reply at your convenience.","편하실 때 답장 주세요."],["availability","n","가능한 시간","B1","Please share your availability.","가능한 시간 알려주세요."],["acknowledge","v","받았음을 확인하다","B2","Please acknowledge receipt.","수신 확인 부탁드려요."],["receipt","n","수령, 영수증","B1","We confirm receipt of your order.","주문 수령을 확인합니다."],["draft","n/v","초안(을 쓰다)","B1","I'll draft the proposal today.","오늘 제안서 초안을 쓸게요."],["revise","v","수정하다","B1","Here is the revised version.","수정본입니다."],["approve","v","승인하다","B1","Could you approve the PO?","발주서 승인해 주시겠어요?"],["pending","adj","보류 중인, 대기 중인","B1","The approval is still pending.","승인이 아직 대기 중이에요."],["urgent","adj","긴급한","A2","This is urgent, please check.","급한 건이라 확인 부탁해요."],["promptly","adv","신속하게","B2","We will respond promptly.","신속히 답변드리겠습니다."],["apologize","v","사과하다","A2","I apologize for the delay.","지연에 사과드립니다."],["appreciate","v","감사하다","B1","I appreciate your patience.","기다려 주셔서 감사해요."],["look forward to","phr","~을 기대하다","A2","I look forward to hearing from you.","연락 기다리겠습니다."],["touch base","phr","가볍게 연락하다","B2","Let's touch base next week.","다음 주에 연락 한번 해요."],["circle back","phr","다시 얘기하다","B2","I'll circle back on this Monday.","월요일에 이 건 다시 연락드릴게요."],["heads-up","n","미리 알림","B2","Just a heads-up, the price will change.","미리 알려드리면 가격이 바뀔 예정이에요."],["loop in","phr","(대화에) 포함시키다","B2","Let me loop in our architect.","아키텍트도 넣을게요."],["FYI","abbr","참고로","B1","FYI, the server is back up.","참고로 서버 복구됐어요."],["ASAP","abbr","가능한 빨리","A2","Please send it ASAP.","가능한 빨리 보내 주세요."],["unsubscribe","v","수신 거부하다","B1","Click here to unsubscribe.","수신 거부는 여기를 누르세요."],["sincerely","adv","(맺음말) 진심으로","A2","Sincerely, Taehyun","드림, 태현"],["regards","n","안부 (맺음말)","A2","Best regards,","감사합니다,"],["on behalf of","phr","~을 대신하여","B2","I am writing on behalf of my team.","팀을 대신해 연락드립니다."],["clarification","n","설명, 해명","B2","I need clarification on item 3.","3번 항목에 설명이 필요해요."],["confirmation","n","확인","B1","We will send a confirmation email.","확인 메일을 보내드릴게요."],["outstanding","adj","미해결의","B2","There are two outstanding issues.","미해결 이슈가 두 개 있어요."]]},{"id":"sales","sit":"deal","name":"영업 · 계약 · 협상","icon":"📝","desc":"견적부터 클로징까지, 딜의 언어","words":[["quote","n/v","견적(을 내다)","A2","I'll send you a quote today.","오늘 견적 보내드릴게요."],["proposal","n","제안서","A2","Here is our proposal.","저희 제안서입니다."],["discount","n","할인","A2","We can offer a 10% discount.","10% 할인해 드릴 수 있어요."],["pricing","n","가격 책정","B1","Our pricing is usage-based.","저희 가격은 사용량 기반이에요."],["budget","n","예산","A2","What's your budget range?","예산 범위가 어떻게 되세요?"],["contract","n","계약서","A2","Please review the contract.","계약서 검토 부탁드려요."],["renewal","n","갱신","B1","Your renewal is due in June.","6월에 갱신 예정이에요."],["term","n","계약 기간; 조건","B1","A three-year term gets a better rate.","3년 계약이면 요율이 더 좋아요."],["commitment","n","약정","B1","A one-year commitment lowers the price.","1년 약정이면 가격이 내려가요."],["negotiate","v","협상하다","B1","We're open to negotiate.","협상 여지가 있어요."],["counteroffer","n","역제안","B2","Here's our counteroffer.","저희 역제안입니다."],["concession","n","양보","C1","That's our final concession.","그게 저희 마지막 양보예요."],["leverage","n/v","협상력; 활용하다","B2","Volume gives you leverage.","물량이 협상력이 돼요."],["objection","n","반론, 이의","B2","Let's address the price objection.","가격 반론을 다뤄보죠."],["competitor","n","경쟁사","B1","How do we compare to competitors?","경쟁사와 비교하면 어떤가요?"],["pipeline","n","영업 파이프라인","B1","We have ten deals in the pipeline.","파이프라인에 딜이 10개 있어요."],["prospect","n","잠재 고객","B1","She is a strong prospect.","유력한 잠재 고객이에요."],["lead","n","영업 기회, 리드","B1","We got a new lead from the event.","행사에서 새 리드를 얻었어요."],["qualify","v","(딜을) 검증하다","B2","Let's qualify the opportunity first.","먼저 기회를 검증하죠."],["close","v","(딜을) 성사시키다","B1","We closed the deal last week.","지난주에 딜을 성사시켰어요."],["sign off","phr","최종 승인하다","B2","Legal needs to sign off.","법무팀 최종 승인이 필요해요."],["procurement","n","구매, 조달","B2","It's with procurement now.","지금 구매팀에 있어요."],["purchase order","n","발주서(PO)","B1","We received the purchase order.","발주서를 받았어요."],["invoice","n","청구서","A2","We'll issue the invoice monthly.","매달 청구서를 발행해요."],["payment terms","n","지불 조건","B