nsion","n","긴장, 갈등","B2","There is some tension between teams.","팀 사이에 긴장이 좀 있어요."],["rapport","n","친밀감, 신뢰 관계","C1","We built good rapport.","좋은 관계를 쌓았어요."],["goodwill","n","호의","C1","As a gesture of goodwill…","호의의 표시로…"],["follow through","phr","끝까지 해내다","B2","We always follow through.","저희는 늘 끝까지 해냅니다."],["stall","v","정체되다","B2","The deal has stalled.","딜이 멈췄어요."],["check in","phr","안부 확인하다","B1","Just checking in on the proposal.","제안서 건 확인차 연락드려요."],["tactful","adj","요령 있는","C1","Be tactful with the CFO.","CFO에겐 요령 있게 말하세요."],["candid","adj","솔직한","C1","I'll be candid with you.","솔직하게 말씀드릴게요."]]},{"id":"career","sit":"career","name":"커리어 · 면접","icon":"🙋","desc":"나를 소개하고 성과를 말하는 단어","words":[["background","n","경력, 배경","A2","Tell me about your background.","경력을 소개해 주세요."],["responsibility","n","책임, 업무","B1","My main responsibility is key accounts.","주 업무는 핵심 계정 관리예요."],["achievement","n","성과","B1","My biggest achievement was this deal.","가장 큰 성과는 이 딜이에요."],["accomplish","v","이루다","B1","What did you accomplish last year?","작년에 뭘 이루셨나요?"],["quota","n","할당 목표","B1","I hit 120% of quota.","할당 목표의 120%를 달성했어요."],["exceed","v","초과하다","B2","I exceeded my target.","목표를 초과했어요."],["track record","n","실적","B2","I have a strong track record.","탄탄한 실적이 있어요."],["portfolio","n","담당 포트폴리오","B2","I manage a portfolio of 50 accounts.","50개 계정을 담당해요."],["full-cycle","adj","전 과정의","C1","I've run full-cycle sales.","풀사이클 영업을 해왔어요."],["hunter","n","신규 개척형 영업","C1","I'm a hunter by nature.","천성이 개척형이에요."],["strength","n","강점","A2","My strength is building trust.","제 강점은 신뢰 구축이에요."],["weakness","n","약점","A2","I'm working on that weakness.","그 약점을 개선 중이에요."],["motivate","v","동기를 부여하다","B1","What motivates you?","무엇이 동기부여가 되나요?"],["collaborate","v","협업하다","B1","I collaborate closely with engineers.","엔지니어와 긴밀히 협업해요."],["cross-functional","adj","여러 부서가 함께하는","B2","I led a cross-functional team.","여러 부서 팀을 이끌었어요."],["initiative","n","주도성","B2","I took the initiative.","제가 주도적으로 나섰어요."],["r